# Store every file exactly as committed and never convert line endings (the plugin directory refuses attributes that rewrite
# file contents). The shell launchers and hooks are committed with LF and the Windows .cmd launchers with CRLF, so each works
# as checked out on every platform, also with core.autocrlf=true. New notes trees get the normalising rules from
# skills/myco-notes/template/gitattributes, which bootstrap installs as their .gitattributes.
* -text
